Engineering, or a related field.\n• Experience with cloud platforms (AWS, Azure, Google Cloud).\n• Familiarity with containerization technologies (Docker, Kubernetes).\n• Knowledge of CI/CD pipelines and DevOps practices.\n• Experience with front-end development technologies and frameworks.\n• Prior experience working in an Agile/Scrum development environment.\n\nPerks & Benefits\n• Competitive salary package\n• Health and dental insurance\n• Generous paid time off and vacation policy\n• Opportunities for professional development and training\n• Dynamic and collaborative work environment\n• Team building activities and social events\n• Performance-based bonuses\n\nHow to Apply\n\nReady to take the next step in your software development career? We invite qualified candidates to submit their application by clicking the link below. Please ensure your resume highlights your relevant experience and technical skills. We look forward to reviewing your application!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'YEAR',NULL,'software,development,software developer,career,experience,software development,professional,norbrook,st andrew,norbrook st,andrew,contribute,team,career zycto,zycto,contribute architectural,st,developer,company,forward,code,technologies,make,frameworks,end'),(186,'jsearch','jfwEemf-o7QJBm9fAAAAAA==','Web Developer – IT Innovator','Career.zycto',NULL,'JM',0,'https://career.zycto.com/jobs/web-developer-it-innovator/?utm_campaign=google_jobs_apply&utm_source=google_jobs_apply&utm_medium=organic','About Company\n\nPropelling digital transformation, Career.zycto is a dynamic IT firm committed to crafting cutting-edge web solutions that empower businesses across various sectors. For a web developer seeking impactful projects and continuous growth, our environment fosters creativity and collaboration. We champion innovation, offering a space where your code directly translates into tangible client success. Join a team where your expertise is valued, and your passion for technology drives real-world applications in a supportive, forward-thinking culture.\n\nJob Description\n\nAre you a seasoned Web Developer ready to shape the future of digital experiences? Career.zycto is seeking a talented and passionate professional to join our innovative team in Mandeville. This role is perfect for someone who thrives on building robust, scalable, and user-friendly web applications from conception to deployment. You will be instrumental in developing high-quality code, contributing to architectural decisions, and collaborating closely with our design and project management teams to deliver exceptional digital products. We\'re looking for a proactive problem-solver with an eye for detail and a commitment to best practices in web development. If you\'re eager to take ownership of challenging projects and continuously expand your skill set within a supportive and forward-thinking IT environment, we invite you to explore this exciting opportunity. Your work will directly impact our clients\' success, driving their digital presence forward with creative and efficient solutions.\n\nKey Responsibilities\n• Design, develop, and maintain responsive, high-performance web applications using modern web technologies.\n• Write clean, well-documented, and scalable code following best practices and coding standards.\n• Collaborate with product managers, UX/UI designers, and other developers to define, design, and ship new features.\n• Participate in code reviews to ensure code quality and knowledge sharing.\n• Troubleshoot, debug, and upgrade existing applications to ensure optimal functionality.\n• Stay up-to-date with emerging web technologies and industry trends, applying them where appropriate.\n• Contribute to the entire application lifecycle, focusing on coding, debugging, and testing.\n• Implement security and data protection measures within web applications.\n• Integrate third-party APIs and web services as required.\n• Optimize applications for maximum speed and scalability.\n\nRequired Skills\n• Proficiency in front-end technologies: HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript (ES6+)\n• Strong experience with at least one modern JavaScript framework (e.g., React, Angular, Vue.js)\n• Solid understanding of back-end development with languages like Node.js, Python, PHP, or Java\n• Experience with relational databases (e.g., MySQL, PostgreSQL) and/or NoSQL databases (e.g., MongoDB)\n• Familiarity with RESTful APIs and API integration\n• Experience with version control systems, particularly Git\n• Understanding of responsive design principles and cross-browser compatibility\n• Problem-solving aptitude and a keen eye for detail\n\nPreferred Qualifications\n• Bachelor\'s degree in Computer Science, Information Technology, or a related field\n• Experience with cloud platforms (e.g., AWS, Azure, Google Cloud)\n• Knowledge of CI/CD pipelines and DevOps practices\n• Familiarity with containerization technologies (e.g., Docker, Kubernetes)\n• Experience with testing frameworks (e.g., Jest, Mocha, Cypress)\n• Portfolio showcasing successful web development projects\n\nPerks & Benefits\n• Competitive salary and performance-based bonuses\n• Comprehensive health and wellness benefits\n• Opportunities for professional development and continuous learning\n• Dynamic and collaborative work environment\n• Paid time off and public holidays\n• Modern office space with ergonomic workstations\n• Team-building activities and social events\n• Contribution to impactful and diverse projects\n\nHow to Apply\n\nReady to make your mark? Submit your comprehensive resume and a cover letter detailing your experience and why you are the ideal candidate for this role. We look forward to reviewing your application and exploring how your talents align with our vision. Click on the link below to apply.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'YEAR',NULL,'web,applications,digital,forward,code,supportive forward,web developer,experience,space,technologies,projects,web applications,eye,impactful,ready,modern